Use SDL modifier snapshots for system shortcuts and preserve PNG sequences.

Event-loop key state can be cleared by focus handling while Ctrl/Alt remain
physically held. Use each key event's modifier snapshot. The shared shortcut
header also recovers after swallowed releases and treats Print Screen/SysRq as
one key. Match existing capture extensions without case sensitivity and create
Linux PNGs exclusively so existing captures cannot be silently truncated.

